          "packaging" : {
            "description" : "Transport Package;\n- Shipping pallet of bags of seed or cartons of crop protection.\n- Seed bulk box where multiple bags of seed are treated at a retailer and conveyed into a tote or seed box (mini-bulk) for use with a seed tender.  \n\nA printed manifest tag with barcode detailed in packaging.identifier must be included with the seed box, tote or pallet for ease of use.\nIt is NOT recommended to commingle seed varieties and seed lots.   But if that does happen, multiple shipped item instances array entries would have the same destination package, denoting the which seed varieties and seed lot may have been mixed into a single tote or seed box. \nThe dimensions of a seed box e.g. https://www.rppcontainers.com/Hopper-Bottom-Containers/hopper-bottom-57x45x65, or pallet are not in scope.",
            "type" : "object",
            "additionalProperties" : false,
            "properties" : {
              "typeCode" : {
                "allOf" : [ {
                  "$ref" : "#/definitions/token"
                }, {
