                } ]
              },
              "quantity" : {
                "description" : "Total gross weight of the seed box, or pallet.  \nThis is defined as the tare weight (weight of the container, box or pallet) plus the net weight, which is the number of bags x weight of each bag, plus the weight of the treatment if seed treatment and loaded into the seed box.",
